  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-07-19T03:42:46.581Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It is incredibly demotivating as a world creator, to see ten different FULL public instances of my new world and only being able to join one. I love the feature that allows world creators to bypass the hard-cap of a world, this has come in handy many times, but I am asking that the UI actually shows these full instances, past either the soft-cap or hard-cap (of course while still keeping private instances hidden).\n\n*admin edit: Title edited for clarity. \"Allow world creators to join...\" changed to \"Allow world creators to view...\".*",
